### UniWallet API — HTTP Test Collection
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Insomnia/Thunder Client
### Set @baseUrl and @userId before running

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@userId = seed-user-001
@billId = REPLACE_WITH_BILL_ID
@goalId = REPLACE_WITH_GOAL_ID
@challengeId = REPLACE_WITH_CHALLENGE_ID

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HEALTH
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DASHBOARD — start here
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get full dashboard (call this first — gives you everything)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/{{userId}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROFILE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Create profile (onboarding)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jordan Park",
  "school": "University of Waterloo",
  "studentType": "off_campus",
  "currentBalance": 623.50,
  "monthlyIncome": 1200,
  "payFrequency": "biweekly",
  "nextPayDate": "2025-04-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "city": "Waterloo"
}

###

### Get profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/{{userId}}

###

### Update profile balance
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentBalance": 950.00,
  "nextPayDate": "2025-04-14T00:00:00.000Z"
}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BILLS
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List all bills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{userId}}

###

### List unpaid bills only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{userId}}?paid=false

###

### List paid bills only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{userId}}?paid=true

###

### Create a bill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Internet",
  "amount": 65,
  "dueDate": "2025-04-08T00:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "utilities",
  "priority": "high",
  "recurring": true
}

###

### Update a bill (replace billId in variable above)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{billId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 70,
  "dueDate": "2025-04-09T00:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### Mark bill as paid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{billId}}/pay

###

### Delete a bill
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/{{billId}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BUDGET FORECAST
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Run budget forecast
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forecast/{{userId}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AI COACH
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Ask the AI coach (requires OPENAI_API_KEY in .env)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "message": "Am I going to make it to payday?"
}

###

### Another AI question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "message": "What should I pay first this week?"
}

###

### Can I afford going out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "message": "Can I afford going out this weekend?"
}

###

### Get chat history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/{{userId}}

###

### Get chat history (limited)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/history/{{userId}}?limit=5

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WEEKLY CHALLENGE
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get or generate this week's challenge
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/challenge/{{userId}}

###

### Update challenge progress (replace challengeId above)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/challenge/{{challengeId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "progress": 15
}

###

### Complete a challenge (set progress = target)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/challenge/{{challengeId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "progress": 30
}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SIDE HUSTLES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### All side hustles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/side-hustles

###

### Remote only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/side-hustles?mode=remote

###

### Local only, limited to 4
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/side-hustles?mode=local&limit=4

###

### Filter by tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/side-hustles?tags=creative,remote

###

### With city filter (cosmetic for now, data is national)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/side-hustles?city=Waterloo&mode=remote&limit=6

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SAVINGS GOALS
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all saving method descriptions (use for dropdowns)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/meta/methods

###

### List all savings goals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{userId}}

###

### Get a specific goal with contribution history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{userId}}/{{goalId}}

###

### Create emergency fund goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "title": "Emergency Fund",
  "description": "3 months of expenses as a safety buffer",
  "targetAmount": 2000,
  "targetDate": "2025-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "emergency",
  "savingMethod": "fixed_weekly",
  "autoSaveAmount": 25,
  "autoSaveFreq": "weekly"
}

###

### Create laptop savings goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "title": "New Laptop",
  "description": "MacBook Air M3 for dev work",
  "targetAmount": 1499,
  "targetDate": "2025-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "tech",
  "savingMethod": "percentage",
  "autoSaveAmount": 60,
  "autoSaveFreq": "biweekly"
}

###

### Create TFSA goal (education category)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "title": "TFSA Starter",
  "description": "First $500 into index funds",
  "targetAmount": 500,
  "category": "education",
  "savingMethod": "spare_change"
}

###

### Update a goal
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{goalId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAmount": 2500,
  "autoSaveAmount": 30
}

###

### Add contribution to a goal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{goalId}}/contribute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50,
  "note": "Tutoring payout this week"
}

###

### Add contribution (no note)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{goalId}}/contribute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100
}

###

### Delete a goal
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{goalId}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# EDUCATION
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all education modules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/modules

###

### Get modules by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/modules?category=budgeting

###

### Get modules by category — investing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/modules?category=investing

###

### Get modules by category — savings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/modules?category=savings

###

### Get a specific module
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/modules/budgeting-101

###

### Get all modules with user progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}

###

### Complete a module (budgeting-101)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/budgeting-101

###

### Complete a module (credit-basics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/credit-basics

###

### Complete a module (emergency-fund)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/emergency-fund

###

### Complete a module (investing-young)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/investing-young

###

### Complete a module (student-taxes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/student-taxes

###

### Complete a module (side-hustle-basics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/side-hustle-basics

###

### Complete a module (debt-paydown)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/debt-paydown

###

### Complete a module (rrsp-tfsa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/education/{{userId}}/complete/rrsp-tfsa

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VALIDATION ERROR EXAMPLES — confirm these return 422
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Missing required field — should return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test"
}

###

### Invalid enum — should return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Test Bill",
  "amount": 50,
  "dueDate": "2025-04-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "INVALID_CATEGORY"
}

###

### Negative amount — should return 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/savings/{{goalId}}/contribute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -50
}
